 it did and that makes it  unnerving and bonus on this it's not  just the midnight entity it's not just  the monster that is scary it also does  with so many great horror stories do  which is to make the humans scary as  well the people are part of the problem  they are just as dangerous if not more  so than this thing that we don't even  understand what it is and how it works  and just watching it progress as it cuz  I mean initially they're you know having  something repeat your words back to you  that's just annoying but that is the it  starts closing the gap and then one is  speaking at the same time of the doctor  and then that moment  when it's ahead of him and it's just  that is such a wonderful moment  perfectly built up to perfectly executed  wonderfully tense the instant this thing  is introduced into the setting until it  is go even after it's gone you're still  because you don't know what it was  you're still going and that is why from  my money midnight is the scariest  episode of new whoo  so those are my thoughts that's my list  what are your thoughts do you have a  list you want to throw out there  whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments let's  talk about it don't forget to like  subscribe check me out on Twitter I  council of geeks give a listen to the  council of geeks podcast available on  iTunes and stitcher I am also one half  of leap punch like a girl podcast  available on the fire and water Network  Fire and Water podcast calm until next  time this council is adjourned  [Applause]  [Applause]
 

